= Instructions

Fill a #Moscow Mule mug (or highball glass){} with @Ice{}, then add the @Vodka{2 oz} and 
freshly squeezed @Lime juice{1/2 oz}.

Top with the chilled @Ginger beer{3 oz}.

Garnish with a @Lime wheel{}.